{"answer": "Figure 9左右两侧框内均标有英文“Crystalline region”，中间黄色虚线框标有“Amorphous region”。 [2]\n两侧区域的蓝色线条基本呈水平直线、彼此平行且排列整齐；中间区域的蓝色线条弯曲、起伏、相互交叉且不规则，排列明显更无序。 [2]", "citation_validation": {"attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "claim_index": null, "draft": null, "draft_sha256": null, "field": null, "message": null, "rule_code": null, "status": "passed", "supplied_refs": ["[1]", "[2]", "[3]", "[4]", "[5]"]}], "draft_policy": "failed_structured_generations_only", "first_failure_only": true, "scope": "structural_validation_only", "version": "citation-validation-trace-v1"}, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_aa885c8fecba9a1870fa", "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "excerpt": "[章节标签（程序整理，非原文）] 3. Results and Discussions > 3.4. Correlation between CI and Content of Inter-Molecular H-Bonds during PFI Refining\n[原文]\nFigure 9. The illustration of a two-phase structure of cellulose.", "filename": "Li-2020-PFI-refining-aggregation-structure-cellulose.pdf", "page_end": 11, "page_start": 11, "ref": "[2]", "source_chunks": [{"chunk_id": "chk_aa885c8fecba9a1870fa", "chunk_index": 65, "kind": "figure_caption", "page_end": 11, "page_start": 11, "text": "[章节标签（程序整理，非原文）] 3. Results and Discussions > 3.4. Correlation between CI and Content of Inter-Molecular H-Bonds during PFI Refining\n[原文]\nFigure 9. The illustration of a two-phase structure of cellulose."}], "visual_assets": [{"bbox": [147, 336, 847, 643], "byte_size": 239666, "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "height": 647, "id": "img_59204b906609a1c0cfcc", "image_path": "visual-assets/7abc37a2c9c66d20b67e228e1566b63630e7369faa7cd074fd1a8a1294d28f59.png", "kind": "figure", "label": "Figure 9", "page": 11, "parent_chunk_id": "chk_aa885c8fecba9a1870fa", "sha256": "7abc37a2c9c66d20b67e228e1566b63630e7369faa7cd074fd1a8a1294d28f59", "width": 1043}]}], "embedding_usage": {"image_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 114, "total_tokens": 114}, "generation_calls": [{"attempt": 1, "model_info": {"image_count": 4, "images": [{"asset_id": "img_468925894a0c5df4d6a0",