{"answer": "Figure 2的图例中，橙色柱标注为 Drainability，绿色柱标注为 WRV；图注将该图描述为 beating degree 与 WRV 的结果。 [4]\nFigure 2的左侧纵轴为 Drainability（°SR），右侧纵轴为 WRV（%）。 [4]\n因此橙色柱应按左轴 Drainability（°SR）读取，绿色柱应按右轴 WRV（%）读取。 [4]\n不能直接按橙色柱与绿色柱的高低比较两个指标的大小，因为二者对应不同纵轴、单位和量程（左轴标度为0–100 °SR，右轴标度为0–200 %）。 [4]\n若要比较，应分别读取各自纵轴的数值，或只比较同一指标在不同 refining revolutions 下的变化。 [4]", "citation_validation": {"attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "claim_index": null, "draft": null, "draft_sha256": null, "field": null, "message": null, "rule_code": null, "status": "passed", "supplied_refs": ["[1]", "[2]", "[3]", "[4]", "[5]"]}], "draft_policy": "failed_structured_generations_only", "first_failure_only": true, "scope": "structural_validation_only", "version": "citation-validation-trace-v1"}, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_37e5528e8514af77fea7", "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "excerpt": "[章节标签（程序整理，非原文）] 3. Results and Discussions > 3.1. The Morphological Analysis, Swelling, and Mechanical Properties\n[原文]\nFigure 2. The beating degree and Water Retention Value (WRV) for the unrefined and refined samples: (a) softwood fibers and (b) hardwood fibers.", "filename": "Li-2020-PFI-refining-aggregation-structure-cellulose.pdf", "page_end": 5, "page_start": 5, "ref": "[4]", "source_chunks": [{"chunk_id": "chk_37e5528e8514af77fea7", "chunk_index": 32, "kind": "figure_caption", "page_end": 5, "page_start": 5, "text": "[章节标签（程序整理，非原文）] 3. Results and Discussions > 3.1. The Morphological Analysis, Swelling, and Mechanical Properties\n[原文]\nFigure 2. The beating degree and Water Retention Value (WRV) for the unrefined and refined samples: (a) softwood fibers and (b) hardwood fibers."}], "visual_assets": [{"bbox": [156, 97, 838, 289], "byte_size": 37600, "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "height": 405, "id": "img_417cfb54ab7b96d68fe6", "image_path": "visual-assets/66b1cffac612276b192593b474d192742b3beae4322872c315c1f05bf6634799.png", "kind": "figure", "label": "Figure 2", "page": 5, "parent_chunk_id": "chk_37e5528e8514af77fe